        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-R6414, Victorian 4 Inch x 14 Inch Floor Air Register</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch x 14 Inch Victorian Register with Damper is a great compliment to any traditional decor. The fancy design makes it a great choice for historic home remodels and elegant updates of traditional homes alike. It is available in 5 stunning finishes including satin nickel, polished brass, and black. The Victorian 4 Inch x 14 Inch Register is easy to install and will fit a 4 inch x 14 inch floor opening. This floor vent has a damper, so you can control the air flow into the room. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available Matching:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-10-inch-victorian-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r6410\"<b>4 Inch x 10 Inch Victorian Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-12-inch-victorian-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r6412\"<b>4 Inch x 12 Inch Victorian Floor Register</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Victorian 4 Inch x 14 Inch Brass Register:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Damper Box to control the airflow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brass Accents Floor Air Register is designed to fit snugly into ducts. When determining the size of register you require, measure the opening in the floor and not the overall size of any existing registers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BRA-reg-finishes.jpg?v=1704354502\" width=\"566\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents Register Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
